=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ FASTFETCH @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt vms-fastfetch @VERSION@: a fastfetch-compatible system information tool for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt MIT License; follows fastfetch and bundles yyjson (both MIT). See [FASTFETCH.DOC]NOTICE.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [FASTFETCH.DOC]README.VMS and CONFIG.MD under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for vms-fastfetch
    At system startup: to define FASTFETCH$ROOT and FASTFETCH$PRESETS at
    every boot, add this line to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:FASTFETCH$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the FASTFETCH command, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @FASTFETCH$ROOT:[000000]FASTFETCH$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE FASTFETCH removes the product and deassigns the logical names.
